# ArcGift web env.
#
# Testnet and Mainnet are NOT configured here. Their RPC, USDC, explorer and ArcGift contract
# addresses live in src/config/networks.json and the user picks one with the navbar selector.
#
# Optional: a local anvil chain for development / E2E only. Never enable in production.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_LOCAL_NETWORK=true
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LOCAL_RPC_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8545
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LOCAL_USDC_ADDRESS=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LOCAL_GIFT_ADDRESS=
